       Proton Pass, falling back to the agent. Renders empty if neither answers,
       and config.tmpl then omits user.signingkey so commits fail loudly.

       Both calls must stay guarded: protonPass aborts the entire template when
       pass-cli fails, and `output` does the same on a non-zero exit. */ -}}
